// D goes out on Q0 while S is off, on Q1 while it's on.
name DEMUX 1:2
port d D in
port s S in
port p Q0 out
port q Q1 out
alu U stone
chip U 0 NOT
chip U 1 AND
chip U 2 AND
wire U in:S 0:A
wire U in:W 1:A
wire U 0:Q 1:B
wire U in:W 2:A
wire U in:S 2:B
wire U 1:Q out:E
wire U 2:Q out:N
layer
..q.
d-Up
..-.
..s.
